abase operations?\", \"What specific strategies would you implement to improve incident response time, and how would you measure their effectiveness?\", \"Given the constraints of budget and time, how would you optimize the database performance on AWS and Azure platforms?\", \"What measures would you take to ensure data security and integrity during the optimization process?\", \"How would you engage with the development team to align database requirements with business objectives?\", \"Considering the current system strain, what infrastructure scaling solutions would you propose to improve system reliability?\", \"How would you communicate progress and challenges to stakeholders to manage expectations effectively?\" ], \"tables\": [ { \"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"Current Metrics & Performance\", \"description\": \"Key performance indicators for Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions role\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"metric_name\", \"label\": \"Metric\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"current_value\", \"label\": \"Current Value\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"target_value\", \"label\": \"Target\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"variance\", \"label\": \"Variance\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"trend\", \"label\": \"Trend\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"↑ Improving\", \"→ Stable\", \"↓ Declining\"]} ], \"rows\": [ {\"metric_name\": \"System Availability\", \"current_value\": \"98%\", \"target_value\": \"99.9%\", \"variance\": \"-1.9%\", \"trend\": \"↓ Declining\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Incident Response Time\", \"current_value\": \"20 minutes\", \"target_value\": \"10 minutes\", \"variance\": \"+10 minutes\", \"trend\": \"↓ Declining\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Database Performance\", \"current_value\": \"7/10\", \"target_value\": \"9/10\", \"variance\": \"-2\", \"trend\": \"→ Stable\"} ] }, { \"table_id\": \"scenario_data\", \"title\": \"Situation/Context Data\", \"description\": \"Contextual information relevant to the 