oned, but not specific frameworks.\", \"is_required\": true },{ \"skill_name\": \"Security and Data Protection\", \"category\": \"Technical\", \"score\": 5, \"evidence\": \"The answers did not address security and data protection explicitly.\", \"is_required\": true }], \"psychometric_scores\": [{ \"name\": \"Cognitive Ability\", \"description\": \"Analytical thinking, logical reasoning, pattern recognition\", \"score\": 6, \"evidence\": \"The candidate displayed analytical thinking in addressing deployment frequency challenges, but lacked depth in logical reasoning.\" },{ \"name\": \"Problem Solving Approach\", \"description\": \"Structured methodology, creativity, root cause analysis\", \"score\": 7, \"evidence\": \"The candidate provided a structured methodology for improving deployment frequency, showing evidence of problem solving skills.\" }], \"custom_question_scores\": [{ \"question_id\": 143, \"question_type\": \"open_ended\", \"score\": 65, \"feedback\": \"The response outlined several strategies for improving deployment frequency, but lacked specific metrics and prioritization.\", \"code_quality\": null },{ \"question_id\": 144, \"question_type\": \"open_ended\", \"score\": 60, \"feedback\": \"The answer provided a decision-making process but was vague on implementation details and lacked clear prioritization.\", \"code_quality\": null },{ \"question_id\": 145, \"question_type\": \"coding\", \"score\": 50, \"feedback\": \"The coding response provided a basic function but lacked efficiency considerations and edge case handling.\", \"code_quality\": \"The code was functional but lacked sophistication in handling real-world deployment scenarios.\" }], \"final_recommendation\": \"Review\" }"}
